`attendance_corrections.html` + `assets/js/attendance_corrections.js` is the
approval queue: pending count, status / employee / work-date filters, before
and after times, the reason, and Approve / Reject (reject asks for remarks).
The action buttons are only rendered for the maker, and the API refuses
